  "source": "# The entrance hall\n\nKydux's own art, made for the game and under the GNU GPL, version 3 or\nlater, like the rest of it.\n\n- Painted by Gemini 3 Pro Image (`gemini-3-pro-image`) from\n  `tools/art/prompts/image-first-entrance.md`, with the field as its style's\n  reference, then edited by it without its grid (`game-entrance-nogrid.md`).\n- The chain its chandelier hung from taken out, filled from its sides by\n  `tools/art/repaint.py` (fill), so that the chandelier hangs from its ring.\n- Its benches, torches, knights and chandelier, and the openings of its far\n  wall's arches, painted flat magenta by Gemini in crops of the painting\n  (`game-entrance-marked-*.md`, the chandelier asked eight times and voted),\n  and cut there with their outlines (static things); its front wall and the\n  gate's posts cut by polygons, each edge on its outline.\n- Its cells marked by hand and exported by `tools/art/export_scene.py`.\n",
  "cut": false,
